      en: ["Location: Near Merca, Lower Shabelle region.", "Main fruits: Bananas, mangoes, and papayas.", "Irrigation source: Shabelle River.", "Economic importance: Center of Somali horticulture.", "Logistics advantage: Proximity to Merca port and Mogadishu.", "Soil type: Fertile alluvial soils."],
