      en: ["Buuloburde is located in the Hiiraan basin along the Shabelle River.", "The region is renowned for large-scale white maize production.", "Irrigation canals divert river water directly to the farmlands.", "Buuloburde city served as a key military garrison in the early 20th century.", "Banana plantations are a common sight along the riverbanks.", "Sorghum is the primary drought-resistant crop grown in the area."],
